    <div class="mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6 text-center">Value Proposition</h2>
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <p class="text-gray-400 mb-4">AegisAI delivers <strong class="text-white">self-evolving protection</strong> against autonomous AI threats. Unlike static security tools, our system uses generative heuristics and continuous learning to stay ahead of the arms race. We detect and counter self-replicating AI agents in real-time—before they spread.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-400">Our technology adapts as threats evolve. Every incident strengthens the defense. That's the AegisAI promise.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-dark-600 pt-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8 text-center">Why the name AegisAI?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">In Greek mythology, the Aegis was the divine shield of Zeus—an impenetrable protector. AegisAI embodies that purpose: an unyielding guardian between your systems and the growing threat of autonomous, rogue AI.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% comment %} How We Operate - Business Model {% endcomment %}
<section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-dark-800/50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-12 text-center">How We Operate</h2>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
