        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-aegis-400 mb-3">Customer Segments</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Consumers running AI locally; SMBs deploying LLMs; Enterprises with large AI fleets; MSPs managing client infrastructure. We focus on AI users in tech hubs—including Florida's growing AI ecosystem—who need defense at scale.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-dark-700/50 border border-dark-600">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-aegis-400 mb-3">Channels</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Direct downloads from AegisAI.io; digital marketing via SEO, X (Twitter), and content; partnerships with AWS, Azure, and cloud marketplaces for distribution.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-dark-700/50 border border-dark-600">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-aegis-400 mb-3">Customer Relationships</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Self-service dashboards for monitoring; personalized alerts and playbooks; community forums for knowledge sharing; dedicated support for Enterprise.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-dark-700/50 border border-dark-600">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-aegis-400 mb-3">Key Resources</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Python codebase and ML infrastructure; team of engineers and researchers; proprietary IP on detection algorithms and heuristic generation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mt-8">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-dark-700/50 border border-dark-600">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-aegis-400 mb-3">Key Activities</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">R&D on generative heuristics; 24/7 threat monitoring and incident response; marketing at security and AI conferences (Black Hat, re:Invent, etc.).</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-dark-700/50 border border-dark-600">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-aegis-400 mb-3">Key Partners</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Cloud providers (AWS, Azure, GCP); AI safety organizations; regulators and standards bodies (NIST, EU AI Act) for compliance alignment.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-dark-700/50 border border-dark-600">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-aegis-400 mb-3">Cost Structure</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Salaries for engineering and research; cloud infrastructure and ML compute; marketing and growth. We're targeting <strong class="text-white">$5–10M in startup funding</strong> to scale.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-dark-700/50 border border-dark-600 flex flex-col justify-center">
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">AegisAI runs lean with a clear path to profitability as adoption grows across consumer, SMB, and Enterprise segments.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

